    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">When multiplying numbers written in standard form, multiply the decimal parts and add the powers of ten by using the law: 10<sup>m</sup> × 10<sup>n</sup> = 10<sup>m+n</sup>.</p>",
