    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">When dividing numbers in standard form, divide the decimal parts and subtract the powers of ten using the law: 10<sup>m</sup> ÷ 10<sup>n</sup> = 10<sup>m−n</sup>.</p>",
